    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/77f8d43aca534ec3fb485fd7d80eaf26.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/77f8d43aca534ec3fb485fd7d80eaf26.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/77f8d43aca534ec3fb485fd7d80eaf26.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A keyboard-themed game where you battle waves of keycap enemies. Experience the satisfying clicking rhythm, smooth animations, and immersive ASMR sound design.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/676f7cb9d4518921ce7d4673631f4687.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/676f7cb9d4518921ce7d4673631f4687.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/676f7cb9d4518921ce7d4673631f4687.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keytamine offers very simplistic controls, yet very satisfying gameplay. Each key press feels impactful with fluid combos, rhythmic patterns, and a reactive combat system that makes every battle feel rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Chaos System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/70607fb2502c9f4af54f6d595195dff6.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/70607fb2502c9f4af54f6d595195dff6.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/70607fb2502c9f4af54f6d595195dff6.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game has a unique system called Chaos System with 11 different levels, where level 0 provides a deathless, relaxing experience, and level 10 provides a full, intense, very challenging experience. Every level introduces new gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and Customization</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/00044ad62715b6d48323d0b02cfc87fa.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/00044ad62715b6d48323d0b02cfc87fa.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/00044ad62715b6d48323d0b02cfc87fa.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, enhance your attack, health, and defense. Improve special keys' abilities, and customize your cursor character with different skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Scenery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/ffbb174646eae98e78745f53916b8d9d.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/ffbb174646eae98e78745f53916b8d9d.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/ffbb174646eae98e78745f53916b8d9d.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through keyboard-inspired worlds, each with its own atmosphere, sound effects, and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 Chaos Levels: From a relaxed experience to a very intense one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Special keys, each key can change the gameplay completely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 keyboard-themed areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Tools and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying typing sounds and ASMR effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/37c771719c1319e211d5853cc61be2dd.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/37c771719c1319e211d5853cc61be2dd.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/37c771719c1319e211d5853cc61be2dd.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
