fluid combos, rhythmic patterns, and a reactive combat system that makes every battle feel rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Chaos System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/70607fb2502c9f4af54f6d595195dff6.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/70607fb2502c9f4af54f6d595195dff6.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/70607fb2502c9f4af54f6d595195dff6.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game has a unique system called Chaos System with 11 different levels, where level 0 provides a deathless, relaxing experience, and level 10 provides a full, intense, very challenging experience. Every level introduces new gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and Customization</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/00044ad62715b6d48323d0b02cfc87fa.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic