paragraph\" >11 Chaos Levels: From a relaxed experience to a very intense one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Special keys, each key can change the gameplay completely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 keyboard-themed areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Tools and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying typing sounds and ASMR effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/fddd5b6401cd4d082c543fbd3078201a.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/37c771719c1319e211d5853cc61be2dd.poster.avif?t=1753722492\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/37c771719c1319e211d5853cc61be2dd.webm?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614980/extras/37c771719c1319e211d5853cc61be2dd.mp4?t=1753722492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
